    "a": "HKBK College of Engineering was established in 1997 in Bengaluru. It is affiliated to Visvesvaraya Technological University (VTU), approved by AICTE and accredited by NAAC. The campus is at 22/1, opposite Manyata Tech Park, Nagawara, Bengaluru 560045, and the institution hosts students from over 27 nationalities."
